diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 8147d99..c0f5363 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- Transaction and statement dates are `datetime.date` values; dates may be given as `datetime.date` or `YYYY-MM-DD` text.
 - Statements take an optional start and end date (`--from`/`--to` on the command line) and open with the balance carried in from before the start.
 - Journal files write posting amounts as decimal text in the journal currency (format version 2); version 1 journals still load.
 
